  "briefMd": "# Phase 2 · Recall@k SLA on Policy KB\n\nYour internal bot has a **launch SLA**: recall@5 ≥ 0.80 on ticket-style questions drawn from HR/policy docs. Chunk sizes that work on demos are failing on long-form articles.\n\nBalance **chunk size**, **overlap**, and **split strategy** to hit the SLA without hand-tuning per document.\n",
